API Endpoints Documentation
Base URL: http://localhost:8000
API Prefix: /api/v1
All endpoints listed below are relative to the prefix (e.g., /auth/login → /api/v1/auth/login).

Health:

GET /health – Health check (database connectivity)

Authentication:

POST /auth/register – Create new recruiter account

POST /auth/login – Login and get access/refresh tokens

POST /auth/refresh – Exchange refresh token for new access token

POST /auth/logout – Invalidate refresh tokens

POST /auth/forgot-password – Send OTP reset code

POST /auth/verify-otp – Verify OTP and get reset token

POST /auth/reset-password – Reset password with reset token

POST /auth/change-password – Change password (requires authentication)

Users:

GET /users/me – Get current user profile

PATCH /users/me – Update current user profile

GET /users/ – List users (admin only)

GET /users/{id} – Get user details (admin only)

PATCH /users/{id}/block – Block/unblock user (admin only)

Roles:

GET /users/roles/ – List all roles

POST /users/roles/ – Create role (admin only)

PATCH /users/roles/{id} – Update role (admin only)

DELETE /users/roles/{id} – Delete role (admin only)

Permissions:

GET /users/permissions/ – List all permissions

Companies:

GET /users/companies/ – List companies (admin only)

POST /users/companies/ – Create company (admin only)

PATCH /users/companies/{id} – Update company (admin only)

DELETE /users/companies/{id} – Soft delete company (admin only)

Jobs:

POST /jobs – Create job (runs Job Analysis Agent)

GET /jobs – List jobs for your company

GET /jobs/{job_id} – Get job details with structured requirements

POST /jobs/{job_id}/resumes – Upload resumes for a job

POST /jobs/{job_id}/screen – Screen all candidates against job

GET /jobs/{job_id}/candidates – List scored candidates (ranked)

Candidates:

GET /candidates/{candidate_id} – Get full candidate profile

GET /candidates/{candidate_id}/score?job_id=... – Get explainable score for specific job

POST /candidates/compare – Compare 2+ candidates for a job

Search: 

POST /search/candidates – Semantic search (ranked candidate list)

POST /search/chat – Agentic RAG chat with candidates

POST /search/chat/stream – Agentic RAG chat (streamed via SSE)

Processing:   

GET /processing/{resume_id} – Check resume processing status

Interviews:

POST /interviews – Create interview + generate questions

GET /interviews/{id} – Get interview details with questions

POST /interviews/{id}/answers – Submit candidate answers

POST /interviews/{id}/evaluate – Run Evaluation Agent

